 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nTalleres Mediterráneo SA                                  MASTER SERVICES\nCalle Mayor 15, 46001 Valencia, Spain                    AGREEMENT\nCIF/NIF: ESB55968796\nReg No: ES-813657\n\nFROM                                                     FACTURAR A\nTalleres Mediterráneo SA                                 Suministros del Norte SL\nCalle Mayor 15                                           Calle Mayor 15\n46001 Valencia                                           28001 Madrid\nSpain                                                    Spain\nVAT: ESB55968796\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 19/05/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Talleres\nMediterráneo SA, with its registered office at Calle Mayor 15, Valencia (\"Party A\"), and Suministros del Norte SL, with its registered office\nat Calle Mayor 15, Madrid (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of Switzerland.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A      Talleres Mediterráneo SA / Lucía Fernández\nParty B      Suministros del Norte SL / Carlos García\nDate         19/05/2026\n\n## Barcodes:\n\nBarcode: 3218581886778\n\n---",
